            "Ultra-realistic cinematic slow motion video of a confident woman with long blonde hair slowly sinking underwater. Only her face and upper chest are visible in frame. The camera is close up and centered, framing from just below the collarbone to slightly above the top of her head.\nShe maintains calm eye contact with the camera as she gently descends. Hair floats weightlessly around her face. Soft natural light beams filter down through the water from above. Tiny air bubbles rise past her skin. The mood is powerful, emotional, and ethereal rather than distressed.\nWater is clear blue with subtle particles catching the light. Skin tones are natural and detailed. 4K resolution, high detail, shallow depth of field, cinematic color grading, dramatic lighting, slow motion, editorial luxury aesthetic.\nExpression is serene and strong, not panicked. The feeling is symbolic of surrender, rebirth, and transformation.\nNo full body visible. No chaotic splashing. No horror elements. No drowning distress. Just calm immersion."
